Article 7: Study Deferment
(1) Study deferment may be granted for the following reasons:
(a) health;
(b) personal;
(c) Gap Y ear;
(d) GPA < 1.00;
(e) disciplinary action;
(f) national interest;
(g) national emergency;
(h) other reasons approved by the Senate.
